                  Prioris, and Starion are trademarks of Digital 
                  Equipment Corporation.  Microsoft and Windows are 
                  registered trademarks and Windows NT is a 
                  trademark of Microsoft Corporation.  Intel and 
                  Pentium are registered trademarks and Pentium Pro 
                  is a trademark of Intel Corporation.  Other 
                  trademarks are property of their respective 
                  companies.

