     Alpha systems will provide the processing power for Northrop 
Grumman's software support laboratory, which develops applications 
for executing pilot tasks; integrating and analyzing performance of 
avionics systems such as radar, navigation, controls and displays; 
communications; and building systems for environmental, avionics and 
