AlphaStation 250 workstation; and AlphaStation 600 systems, the 
world's fastest workstations. AlphaStation workstations run OpenVMS, 
Digital UNIX, and Windows NT. 

     Digital's Alpha family of 64-RISC servers includes the 
AlphaServer 8400 and 8200 enterprise servers, which deliver 
mainframe performance at a fraction of the cost; AlphaServer 2100 
and 2000 systems, ideal application and network servers; and 
AlphaServer 1000 and 400 systems for departmental and workgroup 
applications. Digital offers a balanced choice of processor speed; 
single- and multi-processor configurations; Digital UNIX, Windows 
NT, and OpenVMS operating systems; symmetric multiprocessing and 
high availability features; and thousands of popular applications. 

